surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Keefe</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ghazzi</surname><given-names>MN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Troglitazone improves ovulation and hirsutism in the polycystic ovary syndrome: a multicenter, double blind, placebo-controlled trial</article-title><source>J Clin Endocr Metab</source><year>2001</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>1626</fpage><lpage>1632</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11297595</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1210/jc.86.4.1626</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ghazeeri</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kutteh</surname><given-names>WH</given-names></name><name><surname>Bryer-Ash</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Haas</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Ke</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of rosiglitazone on spontaneous and clomiphene citrate-induced ovulation in women with polycystic ovary syndrome</article-title><source>Fertil Steril</source><year>2003</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>562</fpage><lpage>564</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12620440</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0015-0282(02)04843-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Arlt</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Auchus</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>WL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Thiazolidenediones but not metformin directly inhibit the steroidogenic enzymes P450c17 and 3&#x003b2;-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>2001</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>16767</fpage><lpage>16771</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11278997</p